Z||000012||trigger||03-23-2001||08:51 PM||||BBJ,<P>I know what you mean.  I have the only fiero at my school and 1 of the 3 in town (till i buy the 87 coupe and dad gets the 87 GT w/ 5spd.  I get no respect from just about everybody, and half of those idiots drive their mom's front driver or some rusted out piece of junk.  I basically tell to go away.  You have the same problem in computers as I do, but my advantage is I'm the sophmore and they're the freshmen.  I got one of those fiero haters kicked out for good today.  The thing is my 88 4cyl coupe auto is one of the fastest cars in school (I'll out handle and out stop anybody else).  My friends 73 mustang is no longer in competition since it was totalled last friday night.  The problem is you always have somebody that is just plain jealous that you drive a nicer car than they do.  I don't pick on people because my car is nicer or they don't have one, and as a result my car gets keyed in transportation class.  Thanks.  Sorry so long, I just needed to vent.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trigger.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by trigger (edited 03-23-2001).]||||reg||8
Z||000013||WKDFIRO||03-24-2001||06:12 AM||||I love it when people talk trash about my Fiero. I like it when the muscle car guys mouth off but I ESPECIALLY love it coming from the import guys!<P>All I have to do is start the engine. <P>The loping of the cam burbling through 2 1/2 inch exhaust coming out of a black 85 GT with Formula nose and tail and big tires.....<BR>and that heady V6 sound that you can't get from a 4 cylinder...<P>WWWWWOOOOOOOOMMMMMMMAAAAAAAAAAA!<P>About that time is when someone remarks about seeing blue flames shooting out of my exhaust when I downshift (LOVE that cam!)<P>I usually don't have any problems after that.||||reg||6
Z||000014||pHoOl||03-24-2001||12:38 PM||||I hate when people bad mouth my car.  They sit there and talk about how it's gonna burn and it's a death trap and such.  I told them about my friend to drove his 84 2m4 into the side of a taurus at 45 and totalled the hell out of the taurus and drove his fiero home.  That is damned impressive.  (he wasn't at fault btw, she pulled out in front of him)<P>But then after i take them for a ride, and corner at 35-40, they shut up really quick.  I had one of my friends who rode in it the other day said "damn, this thing is a race car" and that was before i started the engine.<P><BR>BTW, how did you get flames out the pipe?  i've been thinking about making a system to inject fuel into the pipes at the end to launch some flames, but i'm afraid of it backfiring and blowing up the entire car.  <P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
